              <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__part-2__amdact-3__item-2">
                <num>10</num>
                <heading>Saving provision</heading>
                <content>
                  <p>Despite the repeal of <ref href="#sec-8">section 8</ref> of the <i>Dairy Produce Act 1986 </i>made by this Part, that section, as in force immediately before the commencement of this item, continues to apply on and after that commencement in relation to information provided under subsection 27(3A) of the <i>Primary Industries Levies and Charges Collection Act 1991 </i>before that commencement.</p>
                </content>
